2. Definitions.—In this Ordinance, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,—

(a) “Authority” means the Export Processing Zones Authority established under section 4;

(b) “Board” means the Board constituted under section 5;

(c) “bonded area” means an area declared as a public warehouse under section 12

of the Customs Act, 1969 (IV of 1969) ;

(d) “Chairman” means the Chairman of the Authority;

(da) “Export Processing Zone developer and operator” Means a company incorporated in Pakistan which has entered into an agreement with Authority for the development and Operations of Private and Public Participated Export Processing Zones.

